    'tut.settings-business.desc': 'Update your business name, currency, and other settings. These values are used throughout the app.',
    'tut.settings-business.instruction': 'Review the business information and ensure your currency setting matches your local currency for accurate financial reporting.',
    'tut.settings-modules.title': 'Managing Modules',
    'tut.settings-modules.desc': 'The Modules tab lets you enable or disable features. Disable modules you don\\\'t use to keep the interface clean and focused.',
    'tut.settings-modules.instruction': 'Click the Modules tab. Toggle switches on for features you use (Inventory, Sales, Expenses, etc.) and off for those you don\\\'t need. Changes apply immediately.',
    'tut.settings-best-practices.title': 'Settings Best Practices',
    'tut.settings-best-practices.desc': 'Optimize your setup with these recommendations.',
    'tut.settings-best-practices.instruction': '• Choose a theme that reduces eye strain during long sessions\n• Set the correct currency before recording any transactions\n• Enable only the modules you actively use\n• Review settings periodically as your business grows',
    'tut.tutorial-warehouses.title': 'Warehouse Management',
    'tut.tutorial-warehouses.desc': 'Learn how to manage multiple warehouses, track stock across locations, and organize inventory by storage area.',
    'tut.warehouses-welcome.title': 'Managing Warehouses',
    'tut.warehouses-welcome.desc': 'The Warehouses screen lets you organize inventory across multiple physical storage locations.',
    'tut.warehouses-welcome.instruction': 'This is your warehouse management hub. From here you can view all storage locations, add new warehouses, transfer stock between sites, and adjust inventory quantities. Take a moment to explore the layout before we begin.',
    'tut.warehouses-add-open.title': 'Adding a Warehouse',
    'tut.warehouses-add-open.desc': 'Create new warehouse records with names, locations, manager information, and contact details.',
    'tut.warehouses-add-open.instruction': 'Click "Add Warehouse" to open the form. We\\\'ll walk through each field.',
    'tut.warehouses-add-dialog.title': 'Add Warehouse Form',
    'tut.warehouses-add-dialog.desc': 'The Add Warehouse form creates new storage locations with name, location, manager, and contact information.',
    'tut.warehouses-add-dialog.instruction': 'This form has fields for entering the necessary information. Take a moment to review the layout before we fill in each field step by step.',
    'tut.warehouses-add-name.title': 'Warehouse Name (Required)',
    'tut.warehouses-add-name.desc': 'Enter a descriptive name for the warehouse. Use names that make location and purpose clear.',
    'tut.warehouses-add-name.instruction': 'Type a name (e.g. "Main Warehouse — Bole"). Be specific enough to distinguish from other warehouses.',
    'tut.warehouses-add-location.title': 'Warehouse Location',
