    'tut.order-detail-best-practices.instruction': '• Convert orders promptly once the customer is ready\n• Always verify stock before confirming large orders\n• Keep cancellation reasons documented for analysis\n• Review the order history to track communication\n• Communicate status changes to customers',
    'tut.tutorial-employees.title': 'Employee Management',
    'tut.tutorial-employees.desc': 'Learn how to manage employee records, assign roles, and create system accounts.',
